{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "011a7d4d241f5513419d5d21d52fddefdff6baf29fb9398e2594cfa1a101c1f9", "ja": "（『美！美！美！ビルドUP!!』のPV撮影が終わり、\n海美が戻ってきたのだが……まだ動き足りないようだ）", "zh": "（《美！美！美！Build UP!!》的PV拍摄结束后，海美回来了，可是……看起来她还没活动够）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f3c0de883edb81d8e2596ab6901d3ce79aaca8e2fd4a29756e14c7056ba23c37", "ja": "{$P$}！\nまだまだ動き足りないよーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我还没怎么动够呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "d021b04c3c8464fd822003f87731d99d1ff22024fae3c946d81fa366a13f5afd", "ja": "私的には、ウォームアップが終わって、\n今から全力で行くぞーっ！って気分なんだけど……。", "zh": "按我的感觉，热身已经结束了，现在正是要全力上场——的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "37bb1c1d251d0948d66b271cb5281f88a67b083d5944489087678911df764ecc", "ja": "ねえねえ、この後ライブとかないかな！？\n私、いつでもいけるから！", "zh": "喂喂，接下来有没有演唱会之类的呀！？\n我随时都能上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7114e01586d4dffa81f42214e5702b23c8f429de022bd77eaabdeb489e14b256", "ja": "流石にこの後の予定は入れてないな……。\nそれにしても、すごい体力だな……。", "zh": "确实没安排接下来的日程……  \n话说回来，你的体力真是惊人啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1005_p", "source_sha256": "81e7710bac636cb9977fba72dd8f07082aa808f2de2c8f22c4d78edae01b5d65", "ja": "PV撮影は、同じ事を何度もやり直すし……\n相当な運動量だったと思うんだけど。", "zh": "拍MV要反反复复重来很多次……\n运动量应该相当大才对啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "013bc1b2a22a3846eb228aa077a8ac75d9cc3593bf0b697ef44e1126121f7fc4", "ja": "そう！　私も不思議なんだ。いつもなら、\nここまで物足りない～って感じないんだけど……。", "zh": "没错！我也觉得很奇怪。平时明明不会觉得这么不过瘾的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea294232d02e793b77fd6f75e7fca9f9ecb4645027ee0ff05249553e964e49c0", "ja": "やっぱり、頑張ってる人を応援した後だからかな？\n私も、自分磨きがしたくなっちゃったのかも！", "zh": "果然，还是因为刚刚为努力的人加油过吧？\n我可能也突然想要提升自己了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "38260a078e4cfc225e0b621f2f425003f96dd43d73e32999be9f960f09f73aea", "ja": "目標のためにがんばってる人って、すっごく\nキラキラして見えるもんね！", "zh": "为了目标而努力的人，看起来真的特别闪耀呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c1ba265ce14feae79c82ee71acc16f9c8d5b1c332bd2a76b90cf663b31b02e76", "ja": "なるほど……。海美も普段から\n自分を磨いているから、それでかな？", "zh": "原来如此……。海美平时也一直在磨炼自己，所以才会这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2d2fff838ef52701e0170c88506ea552483af7a4910e3c795097b5dd8b11de01", "ja": "海美も、すごくキラキラして見えたよ。", "zh": "海美看起来也闪闪发光的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "14795a2e84daac8e462ea27c0658db6f74e03f5207840ab9ab916249d71ede5a", "ja": "えっ……ほ、ほんとに？\n私、今回は応援する側だったんだけど……。", "zh": "诶……真、真的吗？\n我这次可是负责给别人加油的那一方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e3a96cffec2064bac9d3867bbff4f00eee150bc4075d38d7a22dc40dc7d7f622", "ja": "そんなに、キラキラしてた？　そっか～……\nえへ、えへへへへへ……♪", "zh": "我有那么闪闪发光吗？这样啊～……\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1b689645d3c21ccbfecf071c215c8b7a05b8b47b99b1d522eae8c243a3a00b49", "ja": "ああ。だから今日はもう終わりにしよう！　今は\nテンションも高くて疲れを感じないかもしれないけど。", "zh": "啊。所以今天就到此为止吧！现在\n情绪高涨，可能还感觉不到疲惫，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d4d63a34fdf8131d3b1166a050aa2c688684547d48a1406c7227d91952516060", "ja": "過度なトレーニングは、ケガに繋がるしな。\n今のままでも、海美は十分輝いてる！", "zh": "过度训练会导致受伤。就保持现在这样，海美也已经足够闪耀了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "352269f5ab1d80b6f4d53e30e4deb7062f646d0e89dc239aeeaeec21c00f1406", "ja": "たしかに……休ませることも、筋肉には必要だよね。\nううっ……そわそわするけど、今日はガマンする！", "zh": "确实……休息对肌肉来说也是必要的呢。\n呜呜……虽然坐立不安，但今天就忍住吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "834dd938ade00661780dba929165cdf96264f3c82662c69fb90e63c4158010f3", "ja": "そうだな。海美が元気を消化できるように、\n次の仕事を入れておくよ！", "zh": "是啊。为了让海美把精力消耗掉，我会安排下一份工作给你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "1d724c3637fe17eec0c93e0d1429f5a94ba234cc4dd48a82ab1cf151c67e4689", "ja": "うん！　約束ね、{$P$}！\nよ～し、今日は大人しくするぞ～！！！", "zh": "嗯！说好了，{$P$}！\n好～的，今天我会乖乖听话～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0614_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4cc812494f49e2451a016cf3033bb25529a2790c2057803b20fa81f3c4178ce7", "ja": "（余りある体力とやる気は、海美の長所だ。\n上手く使えるように、なってもらわないとな！）", "zh": "（充沛的体力和干劲是海美的优点。得让她学会好好发挥才行啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
